# Placeholder so Caddyfile.staging's `import /etc/caddy/tenants/*.caddy` glob
# always matches at least one file (an empty glob would fail Caddyfile parsing
# on a box with no tenants). Committed + synced; real tenant blocks
# (<slug>.caddy) are rendered on the box by provision-tenant.sh and are
# gitignored — rsync runs without --delete, so they survive syncs.
